{"id":"call_raw_file_read_bf89825cf95024e8","name":"raw_file_read","output":"// Package errs holds small error helpers for the demo module. It is not\n// part of the session flow. It exists so the layout mirrors a real\n// service.\npackage errs\n\nimport (\n\t\"errors\"\n\t\"fmt\"\n)\n\n// New makes a plain error with the given text.\nvar New = errors.New\n\n// Is reports whether err matches target.\nvar Is = errors.Is\n\n// Describe returns a wrapped error that names the failing input. It\n// returns nil when err is nil.\nfunc Describe(err error, what string) error {\n\tif err == nil {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s: %w\", what, err)\n}\n","runId":"run_20260917161656_628b54","schemaVersion":2,"status":"ok","truncated":false,"type":"tool_result"}
